prefix_rule(
    pattern = ["git", "push", ["origin", "upstream"], ["main", "+main", ":main", "HEAD:main"]],
    decision = "forbidden",
    justification = "Esto es parte de las buenas prácticas del proyecto para salvaguardar el flujo de desarrollo: este comando empuja directo a `main`, reescribe o borra historia remota (force push, borrar ramas o tags remotos) o borra o reescribe la rama `main`. El camino correcto: abrir un PR contra `main`; producción se despliega sola desde `main` una vez revisado y mergeado.\nProject good practice, to keep the development flow safe: this command pushes straight to `main`, rewrites or deletes remote history (force push, deleting remote branches or tags) or deletes or rewrites the `main` branch. Correct path: open a PR to `main`; production deploys from `main` once it is reviewed and merged.",
)

